      <p>Shopify Email is now Shopify Messaging, with email, SMS and marketing automations. Campaign use requires an eligible paid store, Online Store channel and payment provider; SMS has additional eligibility requirements. Automation setup requires Basic or higher, with Flow for full functionality. Check <a href="https://help.shopify.com/en/manual/promoting-marketing/create-marketing/shopify-messaging/requirements">campaign requirements</a> and <a href="https://help.shopify.com/en/manual/promoting-marketing/create-marketing/shopify-messaging/marketing-automations/requirements-considerations">automation requirements</a> before deciding to migrate.</p>
